00:11:56.560 --> 00:12:02.800
to? How do they use technology already? What are 
some of their favorite training experiences? Sorry  

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:06.720
I'm kind of like rattling all of these off but I 
hope you get the idea like we're asking questions  

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:11.280
so that when it does come time to do the 
actual instructional design and development  

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:16.640
and graphic design we can design something 
that we're very confident that our audience  

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:22.320
will be comfortable with and will be able 
to navigate with ease and all of the above.  

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:29.760
It will also help us make decisions around like 
